    and the rank is a rank.

a thing horizontal a rank with a second thing with the rank if
    the thing is the nextfile of a third thing
    and the third thing horizontal the rank with the second thing with the rank.

a file vertical a thing with the file with a second thing if
    the nextrank of the thing is the second thing
    and the file is a file.

