    the nextrank of the thing is a third thing
    and the file vertical the third thing with the file with the second thing.

a thing northeast a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the nextfile of the third thing
    and the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing northeast a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the nextfile of a fifth thing
    and the nextrank of the second thing is a sixth thing
    and the fifth thing northeast the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing southeast a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the nextfile of the third thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing southeast a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the nextfile of a fifth thing
    and the nextrank of a sixth thing is the second thing
    and the fifth thing southeast the sixth thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

