a file is the cellempty of a rank at a time if
    the file is a file
    and the rank is a rank
    and it is not the case that the file is the filled of the rank at the time.

when the move place with a file and a rank is made
then the file is the filled of the rank.

when the move place with a file and a rank is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the pp of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

it must not be true that
    the move place with a file and a rank is made
    and it is not the case that the move place with the file and the rank is legal.

initially white is a control
    and 1 is a step.

